# This repo's own Claude workspace. We COMMIT the repo-internal dev workflow used to
# BUILD forge itself (.claude/commands, .claude/skills) — these are NOT shipped (forge
# ships from the root-level commands/agents/skills/docs/examples). Everything else here
# is local-only: the template cache, temp plans, settings, and private working notes.
